            </NavLink>
        </li>
        <li class="nav-item">
            <NavLink class="nav-link" href="rules" Match="NavLinkMatch.Prefix">
                📖 Règles
             </NavLink>
        </li>
        <li class="nav-item">
            <NavLink class="nav-link" href="images" Match="NavLinkMatch.Prefix">
